        "padding_top_desk": "64",
        "padding_bottom_desk": "64",
        "section_tagline": "Meet Lisa Testa, M.S.",
        "section_title": "Chief Nutrition Officer& Head of Product Development",
        "section_content_one": "I’ve been a Holistic Nutritionist since 2008, supporting clients in finding sustainable and balanced approaches to nutrition. After struggling with my own weight for over 10 years, I realized I didn’t need a “diet” at all, I just needed to understand how to nourish my body. Long-term restrictive approaches can be hard to maintain and often leave people feeling frustrated. My focus is on creating healthy habits that are realistic, flexible and supportive of overall wellbeing.",
        "section_content_two": "That’s why Raw Generation programs are so effective. They are designed to give your body the nutrition it needs in a way that works, so you can feel more comfortable in your own skin.",
        "section_button_text": "Which Solution Is Perfect For Me?",
        "section_button_url": "#",
